"(--card-border); font-size: 0.8rem;\">Ctrl+C</kbd>). You can copy the "
"entire JSON &mdash; we'll extract the token automatically."
msgstr ""
"Seleziona tutto (<kbd style=\"background: var(--bg-medium); padding: 1px "
