#: templates/_settings_tabs/customization.html:280
msgid ""
"System logos should be placed in <code>static/images/systems/</code> and "
"named to match the system folder name with a supported extension "
"(<code>.png</code>, <code>.webp</code>, <code>.jpg</code>, or "
"<code>.svg</code>)."
msgstr ""
"I logo dei sistemi devono essere inseriti in "
"<code>static/images/systems/</code> e nominati in modo da corrispondere "
"al nome della cartella del sistema con un'estensione supportata "
"(<code>.png</code>, <code>.webp</code>, <code>.jpg</code> o "
"<code>.svg</code>)."

